        <item>
            <title>0.8.40</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 00:10:14 -0600</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/agent-tg/say-halo/releases/latest</link>
            <sparkle:version>133</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.8.40</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Say Halo 0.8.40

- The settings window is simpler. The four pages are now Settings, Transcripts, Replace and Onboarding.
- Settings shows everyday controls first. Fine-tuning is under Advanced.
- Transcripts has Today, 7 days, 30 days and All, plus search.
- Replace has search, sorting and examples for each formatting switch.
- Onboarding shows every step without opening anything. Once you finish, it becomes a short health check.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/agent-tg/say-halo/releases/download/v0.8.40/Say-Halo-0.8.40-build-133.zip" length="16029587" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="spIusXptutXEwkK59fmwMQPi9peJhEk4HHZZ2n7Xeonvrcy3A9FV2o9Cm9Ccm3EOZHW/jls2pc8Rd+F+a468BQ=="/>
