        <item>
            <title>0.8.35</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 16:44:08 -0600</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/agent-tg/say-halo/releases/latest</link>
            <sparkle:version>128</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.8.35</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Say Halo 0.8.35

- With "Tap to toggle recording" on, every press of your shortcut key now starts or stops recording, however long you hold it. Before, a press held a little too long was ignored, so the next press started a silent recording.
- Holding the shortcut key no longer risks stopping and restarting a recording.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/agent-tg/say-halo/releases/download/v0.8.35/Say-Halo-0.8.35-build-128.zip" length="15983761" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="mR/LqBJVxpuTJnGYIbkdHttxdlRpOFSiBxNFT9mkpsQfvhgGvRl8AFOu6MDjRVXSMV5mTWAPR2jZ2BV58w2SBw=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>0.8.34</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 16:07:55 -0600</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/agent-tg/say-halo/releases/latest</link>
            <sparkle:version>127</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.8.34</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Say Halo 0.8.34

- If a dictation comes back with no words, the menu bar now says "No speech heard" instead of doing nothing.
- If the microphone was silent, it says "Mic was silent. Check your input."
- Say Halo keeps the audio from your last 10 empty dictations on your Mac so problems can be diagnosed.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/agent-tg/say-halo/releases/download/v0.8.34/Say-Halo-0.8.34-build-127.zip" length="15982110" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="1n3/TfrcKcYjIX8gFBlqfN094l7CfoCrICup+eSBhR2Uy3X76bm0A6oPiIe5iQHoGa5YsfFo7KNHChHhusI7DQ=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>0.8.33</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 02:41:24 -0600</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/agent-tg/say-halo/releases/latest</link>
            <sparkle:version>126</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.8.33</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Say Halo 0.8.33

- The first time you open Say Halo, Setup walks you through one step at a time.
- Input Monitoring is no longer required.
- Until Accessibility is turned on, your dictation is copied to the clipboard and a "Copied" notice tells you so. Paste it wherever you need it.
- Settings now has four pages: General, History, Replace and Setup.
- The Replace list shows your newest replacements first, and its controls stay in reach while you scroll.
- Shortcuts show key names, like "⌥ Option", instead of symbols alone.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/agent-tg/say-halo/releases/download/v0.8.33/Say-Halo-0.8.33-build-126.zip" length="15943923" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="OhAeOVGe53+H9gkcZpiR7sHt05w4ehZlLfAU5jVKUop/pOnvURdjEsQxAmpVo974ZUde+yMIl9J6m7T3ulUDCQ=="/>
        </item>
